[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17761.99, "timestamp": "04:56:01", "text": "你可以选一个好的。是的。但是，再说一遍，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17763.67, "timestamp": "04:56:03", "text": "权力之物。哦，是的。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17766.15, "timestamp": "04:56:06", "text": "延长线？我可以使用扩展程序吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17769.75, "timestamp": "04:56:09", "text": "电线和延长线？就这么点儿事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17772.15, "timestamp": "04:56:12", "text": "你知道那种盒子吧？你插上插头"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17774.39, "timestamp": "04:56:14", "text": "把它插进去，你还有额外的插槽可以插东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17779.03, "timestamp": "04:56:19", "text": "东西。是的，我有一个。啊。呃，你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17780.27, "timestamp": "04:56:20", "text": "买那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17783.59, "timestamp": "04:56:23", "text": "就像我觉得像驴科特一样的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17784.99, "timestamp": "04:56:24", "text": "或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17788.47, "timestamp": "04:56:28", "text": "或许可以在网上购买，比如亚马逊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17793.03, "timestamp": "04:56:33", "text": "大约1500日元"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17794.43, "timestamp": "04:56:34", "text": "商品力量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17798.31, "timestamp": "04:56:38", "text": "把所有东西都装上条带和电缆。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17801.11, "timestamp": "04:56:41", "text": "嗯。所以当你抵达日本时，你是怎么想的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17803.27, "timestamp": "04:56:43", "text": "你当时带了多少钱？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17809.708, "timestamp": "04:56:49", "text": "呃，我想我"}]